{{party: acme, label=The Consultant}} shall process {{term: client-data}} only on documented
instructions from the Client and only for the purpose of performing the
{{term: consulting-services}}.

## Security {#dpa-security}

The Consultant shall implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect
{{term: client-data}} against accidental or unlawful destruction, loss, alteration, or
disclosure.

## Return and Deletion {#dpa-return}

At the end of the engagement, the Consultant shall return or delete all {{term: client-data}},
at the Client's choice.
